1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 14)

3
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Want something to drink?

4
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,760
What do you want from me?

5
00:02:04,239 --> 00:02:05,639
If it's just to catch up,

6
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,079
I don't think that's necessary.

7
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,918
If it weren't urgent,

8
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:10,198
I wouldn't be reaching out.

9
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:11,199
So?

10
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:14,080
After what happened to An'an back then,

11
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,680
I barely kept in touch with the family.

12
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,879
Some things I only
heard about recently.

13
00:02:20,759 --> 00:02:21,759
What things?

14
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,560
After An'an's incident back then,

15
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,800
Mr. Ji cut ties with our family.

16
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,199
No more contact.

17
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:38,159
After what your family did,

18
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:39,879
cutting ties

19
00:02:40,039 --> 00:02:41,719
was already Mr. Ji's mercy.

20
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,479
My family really is a bunch of jerks.

21
00:02:47,159 --> 00:02:48,159
I know.

22
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:50,560
Mr. Ji used some tactics back then

23
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,480
to get revenge on the Zhou family.

24
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,440
He went after Zhou Corp. relentlessly.

25
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:58,919
Now Zhou Corp. is on
the brink of bankruptcy.

26
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:01,639
My mom and Zhou Chu

27
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:04,360
were both ruined by him.

28
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:07,960
That does sound like
something Mr. Ji would do.

29
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,800
And Zhou Chu already had a ton of messes.

30
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:14,360
Mr. Ji quickly got dirt on him

31
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,199
and sent him to prison.

32
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,840
He deserved it.

33
00:03:19,599 --> 00:03:20,599
Yeah.

34
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,840
But I heard Zhou Chu

35
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,439
is about to get out.

36
00:03:26,919 --> 00:03:29,000
And my mom never lets anything go.

37
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:31,680
She'll definitely hit back.

38
00:03:32,599 --> 00:03:34,759
You know how ruthless she can be.

39
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,319
So what are you saying?

40
00:03:39,599 --> 00:03:40,680
Are you threatening me?

41
00:03:42,046 --> 00:03:43,046
No, no.

42
00:03:43,793 --> 00:03:45,879
I just want you to warn Mr. Ji.

43
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,280
If he's coming back

44
00:03:47,439 --> 00:03:48,719
he has to be careful.

45
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:50,840
I let An An down.

46
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,439
I can't even face him.

47
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,080
But...

48
00:03:56,152 --> 00:03:57,152
But I'm scared...

49
00:03:58,337 --> 00:03:59,976
After all they've made it clear

50
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,680
they won't stop until Mr. Ji is dead.

51
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:03,759
You know

52
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:05,319
they'll do anything.

53
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:08,800
And they

54
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:11,039
are making moves now.

55
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,119
If there's nothing else

56
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,120
I'll get going.

57
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,720
Shen Mo.

58
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,800
I'm sorry.

59
00:04:43,026 --> 00:04:45,026
If what Zhou Yang said is true,

60
00:04:45,496 --> 00:04:46,815
Knowing Mrs. Zhou's temper...

61
00:04:46,839 --> 00:04:48,759
she'll definitely go after Mr. Ji.

62
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:51,240
She might even go after Ji Ning.

63
00:04:52,353 --> 00:04:54,113
That call Mr. Ji got...

64
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:57,293
Could it
have been about the Zhou family?

65
00:05:31,439 --> 00:05:32,439
Why are you here?

66
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,000
I couldn't get through to you.

67
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:35,680
So I came straight to find you.

68
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,560
I was busy just now.

69
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,279
What's so urgent?

70
00:05:39,519 --> 00:05:40,519
Where's Ning?

71
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:42,040
He's upstairs sleeping.

72
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,959
Zhou Yang came to see me today.

73
00:05:47,079 --> 00:05:48,399
What did he come to see you for?

74
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:49,759
He told me to warn you.

75
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:53,399
To warn you how
dangerous your situation is.

76
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,920
Zhou Chu is out. Did you know?

77
00:05:56,079 --> 00:05:57,839
Do you know who Madam Zhou is?

78
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,519
I know.

79
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:02,120
Then why did you come back?

80
00:06:02,496 --> 00:06:04,696
Didn't you already shift your focus
overseas?

81
00:06:04,853 --> 00:06:06,053
What can they do?

82
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:08,679
The Zhou Corporation has collapsed.

83
00:06:09,959 --> 00:06:13,319
I know that they've landed a big project
and are trying to make a comeback, too.

84
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:16,040
Of course I have to stop them.

85
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,360
For you.

86
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,199
And for An'an.

87
00:06:23,639 --> 00:06:24,839
And you're here.

88
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,800
I'm afraid they'll hurt you again.

89
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:35,879
So you want to handle this yourself?

90
00:06:36,639 --> 00:06:37,639
Right?

91
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,600
Some things need to be settled.

92
00:06:44,052 --> 00:06:46,333
The Zhou family hurt
the two people I love most.

93
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,800
This can't just be dropped.

94
00:06:50,279 --> 00:06:51,279
What do you plan to do?

95
00:06:54,079 --> 00:06:55,079
Don't worry.

96
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:57,920
I'll handle it.

97
00:07:01,673 --> 00:07:03,553
So you didn't tell me you were back...

98
00:07:04,697 --> 00:07:06,154
because you didn't want
to drag me into it, huh?

99
00:07:06,179 --> 00:07:07,179
If you got hurt again...

100
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,000
What about me?

101
00:07:13,632 --> 00:07:14,752
If I what again?

102
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,559
If I get hurt by the
Zhou Family again, right?

103
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,560
I'm not scared.

104
00:07:21,959 --> 00:07:22,959
I am.

105
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,000
I told you.

106
00:07:27,839 --> 00:07:28,959
I've always been here.

107
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,720
I'm scared they'll find out.

108
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,759
If you end up with me,

109
00:07:37,199 --> 00:07:40,532
they'll come after you
because of me, and hurt you.

110
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:47,519
Then we'll

111
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,399
fight side by side.

112
00:07:51,839 --> 00:07:53,079
Dad.

113
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:56,160
Uncle Shen, you're here.

114
00:07:57,519 --> 00:07:58,800
Sorry, Ji Ning.

115
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,600
Did we wake you up?

116
00:08:01,206 --> 00:08:02,364
It's okay.

117
00:08:02,399 --> 00:08:03,360
I missed you so much.

118
00:08:03,361 --> 00:08:05,040
Are you here to play with me?

119
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,680
Be good, Ji Ning.

120
00:08:06,879 --> 00:08:07,879
Go back to sleep.

121
00:08:09,399 --> 00:08:10,959
What are you two doing?

122
00:08:12,319 --> 00:08:15,079
How about the three of us sleep together?

123
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,480
Let's go.

124
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,680
In a couple days.

125
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,600
I'm going to a banquet.

126
00:08:26,512 --> 00:08:27,512
Huh?

127
00:08:29,378 --> 00:08:30,738
The Zhou family will be there too.

128
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:33,399
I'm fighting them over a project.

129
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:35,960
That project is their
only way to bounce back.

130
00:08:37,792 --> 00:08:39,433
The Zhou family is on their last legs.

131
00:08:40,226 --> 00:08:42,265
If I can take that project by force,

132
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:45,600
the Zhou family will
never be a threat again.

133
00:08:48,159 --> 00:08:49,159
But...

134
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,319
They'll do anything to get what they want.

135
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,639
Nothing is off limits for them.

136
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,600
So what?

137
00:08:59,799 --> 00:09:00,799
For An'an.

138
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,720
For you.

139
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:12,159
I want to eat at that restaurant tomorrow.

140
00:09:14,879 --> 00:09:15,879
Okay.

141
00:09:28,039 --> 00:09:29,200
It's just a meal.

142
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,960
Do you really need to dress up that much?

143
00:09:31,559 --> 00:09:32,840
Depends on who I'm eating with.

144
00:09:36,279 --> 00:09:37,279
Not bringing Xiao Ning?

145
00:09:37,679 --> 00:09:38,480
Relax.

146
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:39,840
Chen's with Xiao Ning.

147
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,720
You spoil Xiao Ning too much.

148
00:09:42,759 --> 00:09:44,479
He just moved to a new place

149
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,760
I'm afraid he won't adjust well.

150
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:49,200
You spend way too much time on him.

151
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,480
What?

152
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:54,519
Now you're even jealous of a kid.

153
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,879
Xiao Ning looks so much like Mr. Ji.

154
00:10:04,679 --> 00:10:05,679
Chen.

155
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:06,039
Ah.

156
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,479
Please take care of Xiao Ning.

157
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,000
Ah.

158
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:08,679
We're heading out.

159
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:09,679
Sure thing.

160
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,240
Bye.

161
00:10:20,679 --> 00:10:21,799
After all these years...

162
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:25,320
Feels like nothing has changed.

163
00:10:27,759 --> 00:10:28,759
And the taste?

164
00:10:29,679 --> 00:10:30,679
Tastes even better.

165
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,599
Bro, you've had too much.

166
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,600
Bro.

167
00:10:45,759 --> 00:10:47,440
Isn't that Mr. Ji and Mr. Shen?

168
00:10:48,559 --> 00:10:49,559
What a coincidence.

169
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,320
Share a table and eat together.

170
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,120
Come here.

171
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,520
We've already finished eating.

172
00:10:57,679 --> 00:10:58,679
About to leave.

173
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:03,000
Us old friends have finally run
into each other. Let's catch up a bit.

174
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,799
How long has it been since we saw each other?

175
00:11:05,153 --> 00:11:06,273
What kind of friends are we?

176
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,758
You're really so heartless

177
00:11:08,759 --> 00:11:09,759
Mr. Ji.

178
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:13,159
I've never forgotten
you after all these years

179
00:11:14,519 --> 00:11:16,000
Mr. Shen probably doesn't know yet.

180
00:11:16,878 --> 00:11:18,038
Thanks to Mr. Ji,

181
00:11:18,519 --> 00:11:20,399
A few years back I was doing way too well.

182
00:11:22,039 --> 00:11:23,479
Back in the entertainment circle

183
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,759
I almost couldn't survive.

184
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,759
Luckily I fought hard enough.

185
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:30,720
I'm doing even better than before.

186
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,440
Who doesn't know the
dirty things you've done?

187
00:11:35,519 --> 00:11:36,519
So what?

188
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,279
Like you're clean?

189
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,000
Check, please.

190
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,840
It's fine.

191
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:47,000
I got it.

192
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,120
Whoa.

193
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:53,039
Why did Mr. Shen pay?

194
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,480
Of course.

195
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,759
He supports me now.

196
00:12:01,559 --> 00:12:02,759
And who supports you?

197
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,280
And who are you supporting?

198
00:12:08,759 --> 00:12:09,759
So jealous.

199
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:12,679
If I'd known, I wouldn't have
given up so easily back then.

200
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,679
If I'd kept chasing Mr. Ji,

201
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:17,023
maybe I'd be the one standing there now.

202
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:19,960
You wouldn't be able to.

203
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,080
Oh

204
00:12:29,081 --> 00:12:30,559
Mr. Zhao's got a new one again.

205
00:12:30,879 --> 00:12:32,399
A new groom every night.

206
00:12:32,466 --> 00:12:33,665
When I'm done with them,

207
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:34,679
you can have them.

208
00:12:34,679 --> 00:12:35,279
Hey.

209
00:12:35,279 --> 00:12:36,000
No need.

210
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,000
Not my thing.

211
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,799
You're not leaving tonight.

212
00:12:39,519 --> 00:12:40,519
Come home with me.

213
00:12:40,919 --> 00:12:41,919
You hear me?

214
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,200
Zhao.

215
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,360
I...

216
00:12:45,799 --> 00:12:46,799
I don't care.

217
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:48,440
You have to go.

218
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:52,456
Boss Zhao, take care of yourself.

219
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:53,480
Take care of yourself.

220
00:12:53,519 --> 00:12:54,599
Zhao, slow down.

221
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,360
Zhao.

222
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,120
You've had too much to drink.

223
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:56,519
Zhao.

224
00:12:56,519 --> 00:12:57,159
No

225
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:58,360
I'm fine.

226
00:13:00,799 --> 00:13:01,919
You've really had too much.

227
00:13:02,639 --> 00:13:03,840
No, no.

228
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:09,480
Mr. Ji.

229
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:10,559
You missed me.

230
00:13:10,792 --> 00:13:11,872
I missed you too.

231
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:13,919
Hello, Mr. Ji.

232
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,320
You can go.

233
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,240
So you did miss me?

234
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,360
If I'm not mistaken,

235
00:13:26,799 --> 00:13:28,320
back then you sent me away on purpose

236
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,200
to set a trap, right?

237
00:13:30,759 --> 00:13:32,159
Mr. Ji, what are you talking about?

238
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,279
I don't know what you mean.

239
00:13:34,639 --> 00:13:36,320
Admit it or not.

240
00:13:37,039 --> 00:13:38,559
I can't be bothered to argue with you.

241
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:40,120
Do you know this person?

242
00:13:42,519 --> 00:13:43,799
Yeah, I know him.

243
00:13:45,039 --> 00:13:46,519
So what do you want, Mr. Ji?

244
00:13:47,399 --> 00:13:48,399
Set up a meeting for me.

245
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,816
I've got a project to discuss with him.

246
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:52,320
What's in it for me?

247
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:58,863
Back in the day, Mr. Ji was so head over heels
for that hick Mo he wouldn't even look at me

248
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:00,200
Mr. Zhao.

249
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,278
If I tell your sugar daddy

250
00:14:01,279 --> 00:14:02,439
about all your affairs

251
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,799
over the years

252
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,320
what do you think happens to you?

253
00:14:06,638 --> 00:14:08,119
Can you still survive in this industry?

254
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:10,600
And I...

255
00:14:10,639 --> 00:14:12,240
I happen to know your sugar daddy.

256
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,320
Think it over.

257
00:14:15,879 --> 00:14:17,200
I destroyed you once.

258
00:14:18,039 --> 00:14:19,440
I can do it again.

259
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:20,840
You.

260
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,600
You've got no proof.

261
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,840
Who'd believe you?

262
00:14:24,279 --> 00:14:24,679
Fine.

263
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,240
Then guess

264
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:29,120
if I have proof of your affairs.

265
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,399
Just an introduction, right?

266
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,600
Yes.

267
00:14:35,799 --> 00:14:37,240
Then I'll leave it to you, Mr. Zhao.

268
00:14:45,399 --> 00:14:46,679
You're not coming home tonight?

269
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,320
Mm.

270
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,759
There's a business dinner I have to attend.

271
00:14:51,799 --> 00:14:52,799
Business.

272
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:56,120
Is it the one the Zhou
Family will be at too?

273
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,320
Mm.

274
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,440
Do you really have to go?

275
00:15:04,559 --> 00:15:06,480
Everyone knows I'm
fighting the Zhou family.

276
00:15:07,085 --> 00:15:12,426
If I skip it just because the Zhou family will be
there, wouldn't that make me look like a coward?

277
00:15:17,879 --> 00:15:18,879
Scared?

278
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:22,840
I'm not scared.

279
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:42,840
Alright.

280
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,120
Then wait for me at home.

281
00:15:44,399 --> 00:15:45,559
I'll be back soon.

282
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:49,320
If I don't deal with tThe
Zhou Family completely,

283
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,960
how could I be with you
and have peace of mind?

284
00:15:53,159 --> 00:15:55,200
I won't let anyone hurt you.

285
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:57,399
Not even the slightest chance.

286
00:16:00,399 --> 00:16:02,000
Once Mr. Ji makes up his mind

287
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:03,600
no one can talk him out of it.

288
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:06,159
And the Zhou family is ruthless.

289
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:10,639
Going up against them
won't be as easy as Mr. Ji says.

290
00:16:11,919 --> 00:16:12,919
Unless...

291
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,080
Mr. Ji.

292
00:16:25,879 --> 00:16:26,559
Ah.

293
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:27,799
Mr. Ji is back.

294
00:16:27,919 --> 00:16:29,720
Is Mr. Ji coming back
to develop his career?

295
00:16:30,039 --> 00:16:31,559
Mr. Ji dares to come back?

296
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,039
With how things went with the Zhou family...

297
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:36,160
Hey, this is Ji Mingxuan
we're talking about.

298
00:16:36,399 --> 00:16:37,878
He's not afraid of the Zhou family at all.

299
00:16:37,879 --> 00:16:38,559
Ah.

300
00:16:38,799 --> 00:16:39,799
Did you know?

301
00:16:39,912 --> 00:16:41,792
Two years ago, Ji Mingxuan's sister...

302
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:45,080
Oh, we're in for a show.

303
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:46,320
Ah.

304
00:16:46,679 --> 00:16:49,000
Mr. Ji, why didn't you
tell us you were coming?

305
00:16:50,279 --> 00:16:51,759
It's been so long since we last met.

306
00:16:52,679 --> 00:16:54,720
When was the last time again?

307
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,919
It was at the hospital, four years ago.

308
00:16:59,639 --> 00:17:01,080
What a shame, really.

309
00:17:01,519 --> 00:17:02,918
Such a beautiful girl, An'an.

310
00:17:02,919 --> 00:17:03,919
Shut up.

311
00:17:06,839 --> 00:17:08,680
Why so angry, Mr. Ji?

312
00:17:09,359 --> 00:17:12,319
I've had so much to say to
you for the past four years, Mr. Ji.

313
00:17:14,359 --> 00:17:15,559
Thanks to you, Mr. Ji,

314
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:17,920
these four years have been great for me.

315
00:17:18,519 --> 00:17:20,400
Didn't expect you out so soon.

316
00:17:21,612 --> 00:17:23,492
The Zhou family must've
pulled a lot of strings.

317
00:17:24,759 --> 00:17:25,960
If you put it that way

318
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,680
I should thank you.

319
00:17:28,359 --> 00:17:29,880
If it weren't for you, Mr. Ji

320
00:17:30,119 --> 00:17:31,358
I wouldn't have known how to deal with

321
00:17:31,359 --> 00:17:33,400
my good-for-nothing brother Zhou Yang.

322
00:17:34,279 --> 00:17:35,279
Oh.

323
00:17:35,359 --> 00:17:36,359
Allow me

324
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:37,839
to reintroduce myself.

325
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:39,400
My name is Zhou Chu.

326
00:17:40,079 --> 00:17:43,480
Zhou Group is now mainly run by me.

327
00:17:56,559 --> 00:17:58,759
I know how hard it was
for you to get all this.

328
00:18:00,319 --> 00:18:02,119
So you'd better hold all of it

329
00:18:02,839 --> 00:18:04,559
tight in your hands.

330
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:07,160
Keep your eyes open even in your sleep.

331
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,960
Otherwise you'll end up with nothing

332
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,479
and you'll be that worthless

333
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:14,240
bastard son again.

334
00:18:30,680 --> 00:18:32,080
What's with you, Young Master Zhou?

335
00:18:32,599 --> 00:18:33,599
Such a scary look.

336
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:35,000
Scared me to death.

337
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:36,400
Get lost.

338
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,920
Ji Mingxuan came to
see me a couple days ago.

339
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:41,479
What did he want with you?

340
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:42,480
Guess.

341
00:18:43,119 --> 00:18:44,240
Cut the crap.

342
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:49,080
He asked me to introduce him to someone.

343
00:18:49,559 --> 00:18:50,559
And this person.

344
00:18:50,839 --> 00:18:51,839
You know them too.

345
00:18:52,359 --> 00:18:54,319
Seems related to your
family's current project.

346
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:57,559
Did you introduce him?

347
00:18:58,599 --> 00:18:59,599
Of course.

348
00:18:59,839 --> 00:19:00,920
Ji Mingxuan is so handsome.

349
00:19:01,039 --> 00:19:02,240
How could I refuse?

350
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:03,640
You.

351
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,480
You backstabbing traitor.

352
00:19:05,759 --> 00:19:06,759
Hey.

353
00:19:07,319 --> 00:19:09,119
I'm tipping you off out of friendship.

354
00:19:09,359 --> 00:19:10,440
What's with the attitude?

355
00:19:11,039 --> 00:19:12,480
I didn't even have to tell you.

356
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:15,640
Ji Mingxuan.

357
00:19:16,759 --> 00:19:18,240
This is going too far.

358
00:19:30,759 --> 00:19:31,759
Mingxuan.

359
00:19:32,599 --> 00:19:33,839
Zhou Chu had too much to drink.

360
00:19:34,319 --> 00:19:35,519
He said some drunken nonsense.

361
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:37,000
Please bear with him.

362
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,039
Auntie, you flatter me.

363
00:19:42,079 --> 00:19:43,079
You know.

364
00:19:44,039 --> 00:19:46,079
I'm not too fond of that kid either.

365
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:47,640
But alas.

366
00:19:48,440 --> 00:19:49,760
No one's left in the Zhou family.

367
00:19:50,119 --> 00:19:51,839
That was all Yang's own choice.

368
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:55,680
Mingxuan.

369
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:58,839
I practically watched
you grow up.

370
00:19:59,519 --> 00:20:03,118
Do you really have to be so
ruthless about such things?

371
00:20:03,141 --> 00:20:04,662
About what happened with An'an before,

372
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:06,960
I understand how you feel.

373
00:20:07,693 --> 00:20:08,693
But...

374
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:12,960
You just had to stick your
foot in our Zhou family project.

375
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:17,600
What do you mean by that?

376
00:20:24,759 --> 00:20:26,240
Some things can be let go.

377
00:20:27,079 --> 00:20:28,880
Some things can't.

378
00:20:30,039 --> 00:20:31,039
Auntie Zhou.

379
00:20:31,519 --> 00:20:34,359
Don't think no one knows
the things you've done.

380
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,000
Why are you here?

381
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:46,240
Because we're fighting side by side now.

382
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:50,519
I downloaded an app on our phones.

383
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,440
What app?

384
00:20:53,599 --> 00:20:54,680
A location tracker.

385
00:20:55,319 --> 00:20:57,480
So wherever you are, I can see you.

386
00:20:57,839 --> 00:20:58,640
Of course.

387
00:20:58,839 --> 00:20:59,920
You can see me too.

388
00:21:00,839 --> 00:21:01,839
What?

389
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:03,319
That scared I'll run off?

390
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:09,240
Afraid you won't find me.

391
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,000
Stop it.

392
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:13,759
Come with me.

393
00:21:13,759 --> 00:21:14,759
Mingxuan.

394
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:16,640
We're not done talking.

395
00:21:17,559 --> 00:21:18,720
Leaving already?

396
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:21,960
It's fine.

397
00:21:24,799 --> 00:21:25,839
Hello, Mrs. Zhou.

398
00:21:26,759 --> 00:21:27,759
Long time no see.

399
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:30,440
You are...?

400
00:21:33,279 --> 00:21:34,279
This is Mrs. Ji.

401
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:36,640
Shen Mo.

402
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,200
Mrs. Zhou doesn't remember me.

403
00:21:41,519 --> 00:21:44,799
But I remember Mrs. Zhou very well.

404
00:21:46,846 --> 00:21:48,926
Does Mrs. Zhou have
anything else to discuss with us?

405
00:21:49,279 --> 00:21:50,279
If not,

406
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,640
we'll take our leave.

407
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:06,080
Our very own the Zhou family

408
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,519
must never be destroyed

409
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:10,200
by Ji Mingxuan.

410
00:22:13,279 --> 00:22:14,279
Then

411
00:22:15,079 --> 00:22:16,079
destroy him.

412
00:22:17,319 --> 00:22:19,200
Do you know how dangerous that just was?

413
00:22:20,920 --> 00:22:21,920
Mm.

414
00:22:24,193 --> 00:22:26,273
Letting the Zhou family know
you and I are back together.

415
00:22:27,319 --> 00:22:29,039
Letting them know you're my weakness.

416
00:22:31,359 --> 00:22:32,359
So what?

417
00:22:33,359 --> 00:22:34,839
They'll find out sooner or later.

418
00:22:35,759 --> 00:22:37,519
You did that on purpose
just now, didn't you.

419
00:22:38,839 --> 00:22:41,039
Deliberately walking around
in front of the Zhou family.

420
00:22:42,319 --> 00:22:43,599
And even provoking Mrs. Zhou.

421
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:47,000
Since Mr. Ji figured it out long ago,

422
00:22:49,039 --> 00:22:50,759
why play along with me on purpose?

423
00:22:54,779 --> 00:22:56,519
She really was my nightmare once.

424
00:22:58,160 --> 00:23:00,200
Even just one encounter with her

425
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:03,480
still makes me

426
00:23:04,839 --> 00:23:06,759
recall the time I was in that room.

427
00:23:10,319 --> 00:23:11,799
But now I'm not afraid anymore.

428
00:23:14,440 --> 00:23:16,039
As long as Mr. Ji is by my side.

429
00:23:17,519 --> 00:23:18,960
I'm not afraid of anything.

430
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,519
If not for Mr. Ji,

431
00:23:26,039 --> 00:23:27,240
I'd have died long ago.

432
00:23:28,279 --> 00:23:29,720
What's left to fear?

433
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:31,960
I just want to see.

434
00:23:31,961 --> 00:23:33,078
Mrs. Zhou's

435
00:23:33,079 --> 00:23:34,359
panicked face.

436
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:39,332
With her being so paranoid and ruthless,

437
00:23:40,256 --> 00:23:41,735
she'll definitely think
my coming back this time

438
00:23:41,759 --> 00:23:43,160
is to take revenge on her

439
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:45,079
and that I have dirt on her.

440
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:48,960
Didn't they want to fight you, Mr. Ji?

441
00:23:50,119 --> 00:23:51,920
Then let's make them desperate first.

442
00:23:56,920 --> 00:23:58,160
I was wrong before.

443
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:00,840
You haven't stayed the same at all.

444
00:24:02,319 --> 00:24:03,359
You've changed a lot.

445
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:06,680
It's from you, Mr. Ji

446
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:10,040
that I've learned so much.

447
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:14,480
Mr. Ji.

448
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:16,920
I won't let anyone hurt you.

449
00:24:19,359 --> 00:24:20,359
Okay

450
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:21,400
I got it

451
00:24:21,440 --> 00:24:22,440
I'll be right there.

452
00:24:23,599 --> 00:24:24,599
What happened?

453
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:26,000
Oh.

454
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:27,160
It's nothing.

455
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:29,000
Just a small thing at work.

456
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:32,319
I might be back a bit late.

457
00:24:33,799 --> 00:24:34,799
I'll wait for you.

458
00:24:36,359 --> 00:24:37,359
For now.

459
00:24:37,440 --> 00:24:38,880
Don't leave the villa.

460
00:24:39,359 --> 00:24:40,359
Just in case.

461
00:24:40,599 --> 00:24:41,599
Okay.

462
00:24:42,759 --> 00:24:43,759
Mm.

463
00:24:48,119 --> 00:24:48,960
Uncle Shen.

464
00:24:48,960 --> 00:24:49,359
Mm.

465
00:24:49,360 --> 00:24:51,159
Why has Daddy been so busy lately?

466
00:24:51,160 --> 00:24:53,000
He doesn't even have time to play with me.

467
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,559
Don't worry.

468
00:24:55,680 --> 00:24:57,239
Daddy won't be busy for long.

469
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:59,159
Then the three of us
can play together, okay?

470
00:24:59,160 --> 00:25:00,160
Mm.

471
00:25:03,440 --> 00:25:05,880
My orange juice is ready.

472
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:11,880
Hey.

473
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:13,440
Boss.

474
00:25:13,480 --> 00:25:14,079
Where'd you go?

475
00:25:14,200 --> 00:25:15,800
Feels like I haven't seen you in forever

476
00:25:16,119 --> 00:25:17,558
I'll be at the shop in a couple days.

477
00:25:17,559 --> 00:25:18,599
Just hold down the fort.

478
00:25:18,799 --> 00:25:19,879
Come on.

479
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:20,880
Two days of hard work

480
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:22,600
and you're slacking off again.

481
00:25:23,089 --> 00:25:24,048
What a world!

482
00:25:24,119 --> 00:25:25,119
Me, a boss

483
00:25:25,319 --> 00:25:26,999
getting bossed around by my staff all day.

484
00:25:27,119 --> 00:25:27,440
Hehe.

485
00:25:28,000 --> 00:25:28,440
Oh right.

486
00:25:28,519 --> 00:25:29,079
Boss.

487
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:30,400
Are you free right now?

488
00:25:30,559 --> 00:25:32,078
There's a fire inspection at the shop soon.

489
00:25:32,079 --> 00:25:33,079
But I forgot

490
00:25:33,440 --> 00:25:35,599
I'm going on a date with
my boyfriend to see a show.

491
00:25:35,759 --> 00:25:36,960
Tickets were so hard to get.

492
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:39,039
Can you come handle it for me?

493
00:25:39,599 --> 00:25:40,599
Right now?

494
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:42,039
Yeah.

495
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:42,799
Please

496
00:25:43,039 --> 00:25:44,039
I'm begging you.

497
00:25:44,799 --> 00:25:45,559
Fine.

498
00:25:45,559 --> 00:25:46,359
Go ahead

499
00:25:46,480 --> 00:25:47,838
I'm driving over now.

500
00:25:47,839 --> 00:25:50,239
You're the best boss in the world.

501
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:51,240
Hmph.

502
00:25:53,680 --> 00:25:54,160
Chen.

503
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:54,400
Ah

504
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:55,119
I'm heading out for a bit.

505
00:25:55,119 --> 00:25:56,119
Be back soon.

506
00:25:56,160 --> 00:25:57,119
Take good care of Ji Ning.

507
00:25:57,120 --> 00:25:58,679
And make sure he doesn't eat sweets.

508
00:25:58,680 --> 00:25:59,039
Mm.

509
00:25:59,039 --> 00:25:59,839
Got it.

510
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:01,240
Bye, Uncle Shen.

511
00:26:01,400 --> 00:26:02,400
Bye-bye.

512
00:26:25,839 --> 00:26:26,599
Chen.

513
00:26:26,599 --> 00:26:27,599
What's wrong?

514
00:26:28,000 --> 00:26:29,359
Mr. Shen went out this evening.

515
00:26:29,440 --> 00:26:30,480
He said he'd be back soon.

516
00:26:30,720 --> 00:26:32,240
But he still isn't back.

517
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:34,440
Ji Ning is crying and
screaming for Uncle Shen.

518
00:26:34,839 --> 00:26:37,519
I just called Mr. Shen
but couldn't get through.

519
00:26:37,680 --> 00:26:39,440
Can you try reaching him?

520
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:44,640
Don't be in trouble.

521
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:47,160
Don't be in trouble.

522
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:04,838
Nothing's gonna go wrong here, right?

523
00:27:04,839 --> 00:27:05,400
Don't be scared.

524
00:27:05,401 --> 00:27:06,960
No cameras for miles around.

525
00:27:08,039 --> 00:27:09,359
Nobody ever comes here.

526
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:10,960
Absolutely foolproof.

527
00:27:12,079 --> 00:27:13,079
Zhou Chu.

528
00:27:13,480 --> 00:27:14,839
I have to admit,

529
00:27:15,240 --> 00:27:17,040
even though some wild
woman gave birth to you.

530
00:27:18,079 --> 00:27:20,960
you have more of the Zhou
Family than my own son.

531
00:27:21,839 --> 00:27:23,319
I still have a lot to learn from you.

532
00:27:30,279 --> 00:27:33,000
Where'd all that swagger go?

533
00:27:33,680 --> 00:27:34,959
I really want to see.

534
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:36,519
wat kind of spell you have,

535
00:27:36,960 --> 00:27:41,039
that has Yang and Ji
Mingxuan head over heels.

536
00:27:46,279 --> 00:27:48,680
All you people know how
to do is use these dirty tricks.

537
00:27:50,160 --> 00:27:51,720
I can't take down Ji Mingxuan.

538
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:54,799
But I can sure take you down.

539
00:27:56,519 --> 00:27:58,055
Still running your mouth
when you're about to die.

540
00:27:58,079 --> 00:27:59,359
Let him cool off.

541
00:28:18,000 --> 00:28:19,039
Ready to behave now?

542
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:24,079
You got a death wish.

543
00:28:26,839 --> 00:28:27,480
What are you standing there for?

544
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:28,480
Go after them.

545
00:28:33,519 --> 00:28:34,519
Stop!

546
00:28:34,839 --> 00:28:35,839
Don't run!

547
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,400
Don't run!

548
00:28:50,680 --> 00:28:51,759
You're quite the runner.

549
00:28:59,079 --> 00:29:00,240
That's enough.

550
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:01,640
Don't kill him.

551
00:29:02,200 --> 00:29:03,480
Time for business.

552
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:06,399
Next, let's see

553
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:08,920
how much you're worth to Ji Mingxuan.

554
00:29:10,599 --> 00:29:12,640
Use his phone to call Ji Mingxuan.

555
00:29:19,559 --> 00:29:20,559
Mr. Ji.

556
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:22,880
I've ordered everyone to find Mr. Shen.

557
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:24,400
The police have started moving too

558
00:29:26,312 --> 00:29:28,306
[Shen Mo]
